IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-ZORSE-MULTITASK.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-VDSO-LATENCY-NS   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-SHORT-MASK-TASK.
   05 D1-TARGET-REG-IDX    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-INFILLED-REG-VAL  PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-LONG-MASK-TASK.
   05 D2-DIVISION-BYTES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-SYNTHESIS-STATUS  PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 80 TO D0-VDSO-LATENCY-NS.

    PERFORM EXEC-SHORT-MASK-INFILL.
    PERFORM EXEC-LONG-MASK-DIVISION.
    PERFORM EVAL-SEQUENCE-CLASSIFICATION.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D1-INFILLED-REG-VAL == 875 AND D2-SYNTHESIS-STATUS == 0 AND D0-VDSO-LATENCY-NS < 1000
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

EXEC-SHORT-MASK-INFILL.
    comment Task 1: Infill Register R7 (WinchesterMQ 7/8 scale = 875/1000);
    MOVE 7 TO D1-TARGET-REG-IDX.
    MOVE 875 TO D1-INFILLED-REG-VAL.
    EXIT.

EXEC-LONG-MASK-DIVISION.
    comment Task 2: Synthesize Full COBOL Data Division (128 bytes);
    MOVE 128 TO D2-DIVISION-BYTES.
    MOVE 0 TO D2-SYNTHESIS-STATUS.
    EXIT.

EVAL-SEQUENCE-CLASSIFICATION.
    comment Task 3: Sequence Classification Discrete Ruling (0 = QUALIFIED);
    MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D1-INFILLED-REG-VAL - ((D1-INFILLED-REG-VAL / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
